{"kind": "mod", "id": 1533, "name": "More Tag Colours", "slug": "more-tag-colours", "teaser": "Tired of not having enough tag colours to identify your 15 ammo cases? No more! This mod adds additional colours for you to use! 27 of them!", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 21403, "favourites": 39, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.acidphantasm.moretagcolours", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-08T06:02:11.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-08T04:56:21.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-08T04:56:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.5.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>I’m not sure if you’re like me, but I like to tag my cases. The problem is - there’s only 7 tag colours available in Tarkov. This is dumb. I’ve added additional colours for you to use to tag things. Now you can tag all the things!</p>\n<p>There is now a config menu to adjust the original 18 colours to be whatever you want. Try to set them via F12 anywhere except the stash screen.</p>\n<p>If you change them in the stash screen you must go back to the main menu and then re-enter the stash to update all colours.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sBjlG7F.png\" alt=\"sBjlG7F.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S8zIY61.png\" alt=\"S8zIY61.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download More Tag Colours</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-moretagcolours</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1369, "published_at": "2024-07-08T04:56:21.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1533/more-tag-colours/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2556, "published_at": "2024-07-31T05:02:47.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1533/more-tag-colours/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3230, "published_at": "2024-11-26T15:05:57.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1533/more-tag-colours/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4806, "published_at": "2025-03-15T20:26:22.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1533/more-tag-colours/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_